flowchart LR
  C[Customer] -->|submits and tracks tickets| WEB
  A[Agent] -->|works tickets, reviews AI| WEB
  M[Manager] -->|dashboards, SLA| WEB
  AD[Administrator] -->|users, workflows, audit| WEB
  WEB[React + TypeScript SPA] -->|REST + JWT| GW[API Gateway]
  GW --> CORE[Core Service]
  GW --> NOTIF[Notification Service]
  CORE -->|events via outbox| MQ[(RabbitMQ)]
  MQ --> NOTIF
  CORE --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
  CORE --> RD[(Redis)]
  CORE --> MG[(MongoDB)]
  CORE -.->|optional, env-configured, never executed| AIX[External AI provider]
  PROM[Prometheus and Grafana] -.->|scrapes actuator| CORE
